{"chunk_pass": {"key": "85afe7d32dd6a5c8", "candidates": [{"type": "decisions", "text": "The agenda is established to include three presentations.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.30", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.31", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.31", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.26", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.32", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.33"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "PM reports that their computer is not functioning properly.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.17"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "MTD022ID reports that their screen is reduced in size.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.18"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Teletext will be skipped, as it is outdated and not required in the future.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.69", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.41", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.70"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The new product should target customers below forty instead of current customers who are forty plus.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.78", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.46", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.79", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.80", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.47", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.81", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.48", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.82", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.49", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.83", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.50"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We will build LCD screen and speech recognition for users under forty, as they are more interested, while users over forty are less interested.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.75", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.76", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.77", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.78", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.46", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.79", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.80", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.32", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.89", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.90", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.91"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Keep all classic functions but make the buttons as user-friendly as possible.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.95", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.96"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The logo has to be present and the colors fixed, and branding should not be changed significantly.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.105", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.109", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.55", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.56", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.48"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We have the option for more functions.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.59", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.127"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "UI(MTD023UID): We have the option for more functions.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "And we do have to integrate the screen and the speech recognition.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.56", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.128", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.79"], "owner_ids": ["MTD022ID"], "owner_cue": "ID(MTD022ID): And we do have to integrate the screen and the the speech", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We will remove for kids; it's only for adults, so we will use advanced options.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.62", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.63", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.129"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "UI(MTD023UID): Um <disfmarker> ... we can remove for kids.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We will make the basic options very easy with one-button operation for channel zapping.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.66", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.130"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "UI(MTD023UID): Um <disfmarker> ... one button", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We will control only one device—the television.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.132", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.68"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "UI(MTD023UID): Okay one device.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The screen will host the configuration options and advanced features, keeping basic functions on the device.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.137", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.141"], "owner_ids": ["MTD024ME"], "owner_cue": "ME(MTD024ME): and then the basic function just on the device itself, with screen menu to do that", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "What does the screen do?", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.93", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.94", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.95"], "owner_ids": ["MTD021PM"], "owner_cue": "PM(MTD021PM): What does the screen do?", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "There is a risk that making the product fashionable could reduce its functionality; a trade-off between form and function.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.86", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.103", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.88", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.148"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "UI(MTD023UID): ... the fashionable design risk reducing functionality; 'Content and form'", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "There is an information gap or missing content in the discussion, as indicated by 'I didn't see <gap>'.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.69", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.131", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.82"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "UI(MTD023UID): I didn't see <gap>.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The group adopts the management directive: there will be no teletext, and only for T_V_.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.133", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.135", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.136", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.165"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The target user age range will be sixteen to forty.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.174", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.98", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.148"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The information on the website came too late, hindering understanding of required functions.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.82", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.119"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The actual design has not been completed; the design has not been produced yet.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.157", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.90"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "ID feels slow to contribute; unsure if they are too slow for this stuff.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.100"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The physical remote prototype doesn't work well and is bent, indicating a hardware ergonomic issue.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.204", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.205", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.177"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "ambiguous", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The remote design currently lacks line control, which is a usability issue.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.162", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.189"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "ambiguous", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "There is ambiguity about where to place the logo relative to the screen, requiring a design decision.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.120", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.236", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.237", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.199", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.238", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.121", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.239", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.240", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.122", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.200", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.201", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.241", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.242"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "ambiguous", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Place the display on top of the remote.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.252", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.123", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.127", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.257", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.129", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.258", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.259", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.213", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.129"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The corporate logo should be placed on the top area when the screen is placed on top.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.238", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.239", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.129", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.259"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The microphone should be mounted on the top area and be as small as possible.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.248", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.205", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.259", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.260", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.261", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.262"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "There must be a display; providing a screen is essential.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.201", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.241", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.207", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.122"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We should decide what advanced options to put in the LCD screen.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.219", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.133"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Include basic sound options (treble and bass) and an equaliser on the LCD, with limited complexity.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.221", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.273", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.135", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.274", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.275", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.276", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.137", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.224", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.287", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.142", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.232"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The team proposes to implement two menus: a direct button menu and a separate LCD/software driven options menu.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.158", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.254", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.255"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": "So we need two menus kind of thing.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "Audible confirmation sounds on button presses are under consideration, but several participants find them annoying and propose an option to disable them in an advanced options menu.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.150", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.137", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.299", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.300", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.138", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.153"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": "do we want the buttons to make sound when you press them? As a confirmation or whatever you know?", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "There is confusion around terminology for display settings (brightness, colour), with inconsistent naming for color/colour and descriptors like contrast in discussion.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.140", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.302", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.243", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.316", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.265", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.317", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.266"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": "the television itself has also the the options brightness and uh screen colour etcetera. So", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The User Interface Designer can design a menu for all these function.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.305"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "The User Interface Designer can design a menu for all these function", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "proposed"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "The communication with the television is difficult.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.297", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.298", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.347", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.348"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The group will separate the display-related controls from the basic functions into two groups.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.168", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.169", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.170", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.186"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "UI(MTD023UID): Um the <disfmarker> one group for the for the display , and one group for the basic functions ,", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "The menu button should be left out of the current grouping and placed separately from the screen layout.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.385", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.187"], "owner_ids": ["MTD024ME"], "owner_cue": "ME(MTD024ME): l should leave the menu button out of here.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "We will designate certain items as advanced functions and others as basic functions, and separate them with a visual separator between the groups.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.177", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.340", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.387", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.178", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.388"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "UI(MTD023UID): So we make a yeah a line between them .", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Place the screen on top of the layout and swap the order of the groups accordingly.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.178", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.388", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.180"], "owner_ids": ["MTD021PM", "MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "PM(MTD021PM): Well <disfmarker> / UI(MTD023UID): Okay.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Include the extra two buttons for access to additional functions.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.347", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.184", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.188", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.348", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.189"], "owner_ids": ["MTD022ID"], "owner_cue": "ID(MTD022ID): I think you should.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Add LED indicators under the buttons so that only the menu-related buttons light up when in the menu.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.192", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.359", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.406", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.407", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.196", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.408", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.360"], "owner_ids": ["MTD022ID"], "owner_cue": "ID(MTD022ID): Hey is it interesting for users if we put LED lights under the buttons ?", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Use one OK button for confirmation, one separate navigation button, and one Back button, with the navigation button also handling channel and volume control.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.419", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.368", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.200", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.421", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.201", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.422", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.370", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.202", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.371"], "owner_ids": ["MTD021PM"], "owner_cue": "PM(MTD021PM): And of course the four arrows. / PM: That was already decided.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "decisions", "text": "Place a visual separator line between the display group and the advanced functions group.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.177", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.340", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.387", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.178", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.388"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "UI(MTD023UID): So we make a line between them.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "adopted"}, {"type": "problems", "text": "If too many functions are placed on a single button, it becomes confusing for users.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.190", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.349"], "owner_ids": [], "owner_cue": null, "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "missing", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}]}, "action_pass": {"key": "ff0c6ee48c16f719", "samples": [[{"type": "actions", "text": "The User Interface Designer will design a menu for all functions.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.305", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.357"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "The User Interface Designer can design a menu for all these function", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The ME will design the basic function menu for the LCD screen, focusing on the functional aspects.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.311", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.312", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.359", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.313"], "owner_ids": ["MTD024ME"], "owner_cue": "So you design the basic function menu for the L_C_D_ screen ?", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The ME will handle the functional aspects of the remote.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.174", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.320", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.175", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.321"], "owner_ids": ["MTD024ME"], "owner_cue": "Uh all the functional uh aspects of the remote I think are in my department.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The UI will compile a list of the functions to be included on the menu screen.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.163", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.327", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.181", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.164"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "Okay . Y you you are going to make a list of what functions are uh are going to to be on the screen , the menu screen.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The UI will group the menu into two groups, display-related functions and basic functions.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.168", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.336"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "Yeah that's why uh I wanted to to make yeah two uh different uh yeah groups of functions", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}], [{"type": "actions", "text": "The User Interface Designer will design a menu for all functions on the LCD screen.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.305", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.357", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.306"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "The User Interface Designer can design a menu for all these function", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The User Interface Designer will compile a list of functions to be included in the screen menu.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.163", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.327", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.181", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.164"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "I'm going to make a list of what functions are going to be on the screen, the menu screen.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The User Interface Designer will design two groups of functions (basic and advanced) and show them in the display menu.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.101", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.102", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.106"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "two groups of functions", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The ID will integrate channel-changing features into the remote's design layout.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.173", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.174", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.320", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.175", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.321"], "owner_ids": ["MTD022ID"], "owner_cue": "So is the layout etc; I have to integrate that in the design.", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The ME will define the functional aspects of the remote (the functions to be included).", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.320", "TS3006b.C.dialog-act.dharshi.175", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.321"], "owner_ids": ["MTD024ME"], "owner_cue": "the layout and you're function", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The UI Designer will create maps of the data gathered for the project.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.215", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.397", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.398", "TS3006b.B.dialog-act.dharshi.216", "TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.399", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.392"], "owner_ids": ["MTD023UID"], "owner_cue": "we have to make uh some maps with uh with the all the data we uh gathered", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}, {"type": "actions", "text": "The Project Manager will write the meeting minutes.", "evidence_da_ids": ["TS3006b.A.dialog-act.dharshi.378", "TS3006b.D.dialog-act.dharshi.426"], "owner_ids": ["MTD021PM"], "owner_cue": "I have to write very fast to make the minich min minutes", "deadline_cue": null, "owner_basis": "explicit", "deadline": null, "deadline_basis": "missing", "status": "open"}]]}, "version": 2}